          "author": "PAW Patrol The Dino Movie",
          "description": "Ride along with Rex on the back of his best bud Timmy the T. rex as they explore Dino Island in this original story, only on Yoto! \n\nWhen dino scientists Gene and Heidi realize that some of the tags they use to track dinosaur movements on Dino Island are broken, it’s up to Rex, Timmy, and the PAW Patrol to repair the tags and save the day! Along their journey, the pups learn about all kinds of amazing dinosaurs, like the super-tall Brachiosaurus, the teeny-tiny Mahakala, the armored Ankylosaurus, the three-horned Triceratops, and the most famous dinosaur of all: the T. rex! Let’s Dino Do This!",
